{"path":"chrono/c/localtime","title":"std::localtime","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>localtime","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/chrono/c/localtime","section":"chrono","kind":"page","summary":"Converts given time since epoch as std::time_t value into calendar time, expressed in local time.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/ctime\">&lt;ctime&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/c/tm\"><span class=\"kw1029\">std::<span class=\"me2\">tm</span></span></a><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> localtime<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/c/time_t\"><span class=\"kw1030\">std::<span class=\"me2\">time_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> time <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Converts given time since epoch as <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/c/time_t\">std::time_t</a></span> value into calendar time, expressed in local time. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> time\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> pointer to a <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/c/time_t\">std::time_t</a></span> object to convert\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Pointer to a static internal <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/c/tm\">std::tm</a></span> object on success, or null pointer otherwise. The structure may be shared between <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/c/gmtime\">std::gmtime</a></span>, <span class=\"t-lc\"><strong class=\"selflink\">std::localtime</strong></span>, and <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/c/ctime\">std::ctime</a></span>, and may be overwritten on each invocation.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>This function may not be thread-safe.\n</p><p>POSIX requires that this function sets <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/errno\">errno</a></span> to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/errno_macros\">EOVERFLOW</a></span> if it fails because the argument is too large.\n</p><p><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9699919799/functions/localtime.html\" data-external=\"1\">POSIX specifies</a> that the timezone information is determined by this function as if by calling <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9699919799/functions/tzset.html\" data-external=\"1\"><code>tzset</code></a>, which reads the environment variable <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">TZ</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;ctime&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iomanip&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;sstream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    setenv<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"TZ\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"/usr/share/zoneinfo/America/Los_Angeles\"</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// POSIX-specific</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/c/tm\"><span class=\"kw1029\">std::<span class=\"me2\">tm</span></span></a> tm<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// Zero initialise</span>\n    tm.<span class=\"me1\">tm_year</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">2020</span> <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1900</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// 2020</span>\n    tm.<span class=\"me1\">tm_mon</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">2</span> <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// February</span>\n    tm.<span class=\"me1\">tm_mday</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">15</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// 15th</span>\n    tm.<span class=\"me1\">tm_hour</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">10</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    tm.<span class=\"me1\">tm_min</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">15</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    tm.<span class=\"me1\">tm_isdst</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// Not daylight saving</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/c/time_t\"><span class=\"kw1030\">std::<span class=\"me2\">time_t</span></span></a> t <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/c/mktime\"><span class=\"kw1027\">std::<span class=\"me2\">mktime</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>tm<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> \n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1774\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"UTC:   \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/put_time\"><span class=\"kw1817\">std::<span class=\"me2\">put_time</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/c/gmtime\"><span class=\"kw1026\">std::<span class=\"me2\">gmtime</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>t<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"%c&nbsp;%Z\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1774\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"local: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/put_time\"><span class=\"kw1817\">std::<span class=\"me2\">put_time</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">localtime</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>t<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"%c&nbsp;%Z\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>UTC:   Sat Feb 15 18:15:00 2020 GMT\nlocal: Sat Feb 15 10:15:00 2020 PST</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/c/gmtime\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>gmtime</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  converts time since epoch to calendar time expressed as Universal Coordinated Time <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/chrono/localtime\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>localtime</span><span>localtime_r</span><span>localtime_s</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c23\">(C23)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(C11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   converts time since epoch to calendar time expressed as local time <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/chrono/localtime\">C documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>localtime</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"chrono","title":"Date and time utilities"},{"path":"chrono/c","title":"C Date and time utilities"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::localtime","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Converts given time since epoch as std::time_t value into calendar time, expressed in local time."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"time"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Pointer to a static internal std::tm object on success, or null pointer otherwise.","children":[{"label":"std::localtime"}]},{"label":"Notes","note":"This function may not be thread-safe."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"gmtime","note":"converts time since epoch to calendar time expressed as Universal Coordinated Time"},{"label":"localtime, localtime_r, localtime_s","note":"converts time since epoch to calendar time expressed as local time"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":242,"codeBlockCount":2}
